<title>USA: Nutrition For Life targeted by lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Nutrition For Life targeted by lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nutrition For Life International Inc said Monday a lawsuit has been filed against the company and its officers, accusing them of engaging in an illegal pyramid scheme.</p>
<p>Also named as defendants are Kevin Trudeau, a key distributor of the company, and Trudeau Marketing Group Inc.</p>
<p>The class action was filed in behalf of individuals who became &quot;instant&quot; executive distributors of the company and individuals who purchased the company's common stock between October 19, 1995, and April 24, 1996, the company said.</p>
</text>
